9430\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>6</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>我试了，新订阅秒弹，老号看脸，<br>传自己证件和找代过封不封号也没什么规律</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305627\" data-reply-id=\"18305627\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/42d6fb8844df43bd53d559d6d9521171?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yufeng1684\" data-uid=\"815926\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>7</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>老号，前天弹了，也是怀疑当天用了 fable5.2 导致的。<br>没找 kyc，就怕被标记，就算过了也随时封号。<br>先用 oai，后面等等再开新号，看看情况。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18306048\" data-reply-id=\"18306048\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1d7d/8905/477613_normal.png?m=1586326604\" alt=\"XTTX\" data-uid=\"477613\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>8</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>不用有幻想了, 我 5 个 23 24 年的老号,用着用着都是会弹的. KYC 只能找美国当地的白人过，比较安全. 找那些卡商的话，还不如直接放弃.</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18306245\" data-reply-id=\"18306245\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bb6af92c90f23296b10c73902e9e1695?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ivee\" data-uid=\"864735\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>9</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>有个疑问，找人代过 KYC 不核验用户姓名么？账号信息、支付信息和护照信息完全不一样也没关系？</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"有多少是弹了被封的？有多少正常用的？想了解一